OL,3,GNEWSAAdlington's free swimming offer
OL,4,Aafter BBC report
OL,5,
OL,6,FOlympic gold medalist Becky Adlington
OL,7,Fhas offered 5,000 free swimming lessons
OL,8,Fthis summer through her Swim! swimming
OL,9,Fschool after reading a BBC report on
OL,10,Fthe number of children unable to swim
OL,11,F25m.
OL,13,FShe also said she wanted to work with
OL,14,Fcouncils to help young people learn.
OL,16,FAdlington said the issue of pool
OL,17,Fclosures had "been really bad for a
OL,18,Freally long time" but there were lots
OL,19,Fof issues involved, so it was a
OL,20,Fdifficult problem to solve.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
